[metadata]
Name:Bolt Face
Goal:Cast Lightning Bolt at opponent. The spell resolves and the game continues.
Turns:2
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Mountain on the battlefield, Lightning Bolt in hand. Target the opponent. Opponent starts at 20 so the spell resolves and the game continues — at low life the engine ends the game before the resolution trace finishes, which defeats the purpose of using this puzzle as a fixture for end-to-end cast scenarios.

